#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:5
msgid "Text editor"
msgstr "文本编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:7
msgid ""
"The text editor from QElectroTech allows two different philosophy to "
"introduce text in the `workspace`_:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 的文本编辑器提供两种不同的理念来在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中输入文本："

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:9
msgid "What You See Is What You Get (WYSIWYG)"
msgstr "所见即所得（WYSIWYG）"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:10
msgid "HTML code to create content and define format."
msgstr "使用 HTML 代码创建内容并定义格式。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:13
msgid "Rich text tab"
msgstr "富文本标签页"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:15
msgid ""
"The Rich text tab is used when the WYSIWYG philosophy is applied. The "
"different options from the rich text are:"
msgstr "应用 WYSIWYG 理念时使用富文本标签页。富文本提供的不同选项如下："

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:17
msgid "Definition of content."
msgstr "定义内容。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:18
msgid "Definition of font color."
msgstr "定义字体颜色。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:19
msgid "Definition of font size."
msgstr "定义字体大小。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:20
msgid ""
"Definition of additional font options (underlined, bold and italic style, "
"superscript, subscript)"
msgstr "定义其他字体选项（下划线、粗体和斜体样式、上标、下标）"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Text editor rich text tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本编辑器富文本标签页"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:28
msgid "Source tab"
msgstr "源标签页"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:30
msgid ""
"The source tab is used when the text content and the format is defined using"
" HTML code. QElectroTech processes internally the HTML code and compiles the"
" result to be shown. The formatting limits are at HTML code."
msgstr ""
"当使用 HTML 代码定义文本内容和格式时，使用源标签页。QElectroTech 会在内部处理 HTML 代码，并编译要显示的结果。格式的限制取决于 "
"HTML 代码。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_editor.rst:37
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Text editor source tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本编辑器源标签页"
